Act No. 82 (H.733). An act relating to designating a franchise relationship
Subjects: Commerce and trade; franchise relationships
This act requires that a person doing business in this State as a franchisor or franchisee
indicate as such when filing a registration, amendment, or periodic report with the
Secretary of State.
Effective Date: January 1, 2027
